1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,480
Let's explore CENTS Sets and the traits

2
00:00:02,560 --> 00:00:03,600
that constitute them.

3
00:00:04,160 --> 00:00:06,719
Every difference to the canvas of the Lincoln cent

4
00:00:06,879 --> 00:00:10,480
is made by the marks of touch and time.

5
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,160
The cataloging of these marks

6
00:00:13,240 --> 00:00:15,640
is the result of two years of voting.

7
00:00:16,039 --> 00:00:18,760
Out of this catalog, Sets were identified.

8
00:00:19,160 --> 00:00:20,920
Let's look at them in order of rarity.

9
00:00:21,480 --> 00:00:24,879
Verdigris, obsidian,

10
00:00:26,399 --> 00:00:30,640
desert and red are the base patinas:

11
00:00:31,559 --> 00:00:32,960
one notable trait from each

12
00:00:33,039 --> 00:00:35,359
base patina makes a Patina Set.

13
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:37,200
One significant trait from each

14
00:00:37,280 --> 00:00:39,560
base patina makes a Sig Set.

15
00:00:41,439 --> 00:00:44,240
Gold and orange are the noble patinas:

16
00:00:44,280 --> 00:00:46,000
a Patina Set that also includes

17
00:00:46,039 --> 00:00:49,039
a gold and an orange is a Spectrum Set.

18
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:51,840
One full trait from each of the base patinas

19
00:00:51,920 --> 00:00:53,280
makes a Fulls Set.

20
00:00:53,600 --> 00:00:55,520
Only 15 can exist,

21
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:58,479
as there are only 15 Full Verdigris Cents.

22
00:00:58,960 --> 00:01:01,039
One full from each base patina,

23
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:03,200
plus a full gold and an orange,

24
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,879
makes a Full Spectrum Set.

25
00:01:05,200 --> 00:01:07,359
Only 9 such Sets can exist,

26
00:01:07,439 --> 00:01:10,079
as there are only 9 Full Gold Cents.

27
00:01:10,319 --> 00:01:12,959
Contaminations are intricately cataloged,

28
00:01:13,000 --> 00:01:17,799
in 12 types: glue, scotch tape,

29
00:01:19,319 --> 00:01:25,439
3D-black, alien secretion, paint,

30
00:01:26,959 --> 00:01:31,120
obscure adhesive, dark grime,

31
00:01:32,640 --> 00:01:38,200
sea salt, blood, speckles,

32
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:43,680
unknown liquid and special oddities.

33
00:01:44,879 --> 00:01:48,560
A Contamination Set covers any 3 of the 12 types,

34
00:01:48,599 --> 00:01:51,120
and a Contamination Hoard covers 6.

35
00:01:51,439 --> 00:01:53,200
A Set that includes all 12

36
00:01:53,280 --> 00:01:55,760
types is a Full Contamination Set,

37
00:01:55,840 --> 00:01:57,599
and only 7 can exist,

38
00:01:57,680 --> 00:02:00,640
as scotch tape is present on only 7 Cents.

39
00:02:02,079 --> 00:02:04,239
The Chronicle Set consists of years

40
00:02:04,359 --> 00:02:06,719
whose meaning is essential to the project.

41
00:02:06,959 --> 00:02:10,879
1971: the year US currency became fiat.

42
00:02:11,280 --> 00:02:15,360
1979: the year the artist Rutherford Chang was born.

43
00:02:15,759 --> 00:02:18,560
1982: the last year that pennies

44
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:19,919
were struck in copper,

45
00:02:20,080 --> 00:02:21,759
and the last year of the collection.

46
00:02:22,159 --> 00:02:25,199
The Full Mint Set is determined by mint marks.

47
00:02:25,360 --> 00:02:27,280
An S for San Francisco,

48
00:02:28,360 --> 00:02:32,120
a D for Denver and no mint mark,

49
00:02:32,280 --> 00:02:35,680
usually Philadelphia, make a Full Mint Set,

50
00:02:35,759 --> 00:02:38,240
and only sixty Cents carry the S.

51
00:02:38,479 --> 00:02:41,120
Decades Sets consist of every year of the given

52
00:02:41,199 --> 00:02:43,960
decade or decades that the collection holds.

53
00:02:44,159 --> 00:02:46,800
On cents.vision, you can find a Trait Atlas

54
00:02:46,879 --> 00:02:48,479
that defines each trait,

55
00:02:49,960 --> 00:02:52,840
as well as Collector Walls that show completed Sets,

56
00:02:54,360 --> 00:02:56,960
and many more features to explore the project.

57
00:02:58,379 --> 00:03:00,219
The CENTSbot also lives there

58
00:03:00,539 --> 00:03:02,780
to answer any questions you might have.
